on\/Cliques","doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques"]]},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Method","externalID":"s:ST10AlgorithmsST7ElementRpzrlE6joined2byAA16JoinedBySequenceVyxqd__Gqd___tSlRd__AB_ABQZABRtd__lF::SYNTHESIZED::s:7Cliques07MaximalA0V","modules":[{"name":"Cliques","relatedModules":["Swift"]}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"joined","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Separator","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"by","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Separator","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"JoinedBySequence","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Algorithms16JoinedBySequenceV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Separator","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"symbolKind":"method","extendedModule":"Swift","title":"joined(by:)","conformance":{"constraints":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Element"},{"type":"text","text":" conforms to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sequence"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"availabilityPrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Available when"}],"conformancePrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Conforms when"}]},"role":"symbol"},"references":{"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques":{"role":"collection","type":"topic","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques","title":"Cliques","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/cliques"},"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques/MaximalCliques/joined(by:)-n00s":{"role":"symbol","conformance":{"availabilityPrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Available when"}],"constraints":[{"code":"Element","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" conforms to "},{"code":"Sequence","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"conformancePrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Conforms when"}]},"kind":"symbol","title":"joined(by:)","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques\/joined(by:)-n00s","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques\/joined(by:)-n00s","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"joined"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Separator"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"by"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Separator"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"JoinedBySequence","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Algorithms16JoinedBySequenceV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Separator"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}]},"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques/MaximalCliques":{"role":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Every maximal clique of an undirected graph’s simple graph once, lazily, each in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"order (by vertex index): an isolated vertex, or one whose only edges are loops, is a clique of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one. The order is Eppstein–Löffler–Strash’s: by the cliques’ first vertex in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"coreNumbers().degeneracyOrdering"},{"type":"text","text":", then as Bron–Kerbosch with Tomita’s pivot (ties to the least"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"index) and branches in ascending index meets them. The sequence holds the graph, so iterating"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"again gives the same cliques. O(n + m) before the first clique, O(d·n·3^(d\/3)) in all for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"degeneracy d."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MaximalCliques","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques","title":"MaximalCliques","url":"\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MaximalCliques","kind":"identifier"}]}}}